WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:01.089
Solo Leveling - D-Rank Dungeon Arc - Introduction
Arc

00:00:01.089 --> 00:00:04.310
Hey everyone Diavolo here and today we are
jumping into a completely different series

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:06.850
that i've seen a bunch of you requesting down
below.

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:10.710
Solo Leveling is one of those journeys where
we follow one man on his quest to become the

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:14.660
strongest in a constant battle against both
man and monsters.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:19.520
Unlike a bunch of manga that I shan't name,
this Manhwa doesn't stray into the confusing,

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.270
philosophical or profound.

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:26.210
Instead its extremely easy to read and lets
the art along with the brilliant fight scene’s

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:27.210
take a hold.

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:31.560
Dont get me wrong, the story also has a great
deal of substance and interesting concepts,

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.900
they just dont make that the focus.

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:39.110
The focus is always seemingly on Jin-Woo and
his quest to become the strongest.

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:43.890
In this video we are going to cover the first
Arc that takes place throughout the series,

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:45.360
D-Rank Dungeon Arc.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:48.950
This arc is a fantastic way to enter the world
of Solo Leveling.

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:53.199
While focusing on the main character, his
initial strengths and weaknesses, we are slowly

00:00:53.199 --> 00:00:57.060
fed information that allows us to gain an
even greater understanding of the world that

00:00:57.060 --> 00:00:59.019
everyone finds themselves in.

00:00:59.019 --> 00:01:03.750
It seems to be one like our own, however 10
years earlier a random event happened led

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:05.920
to a massive change in the world!

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:10.190
If you want to find out more, Subscribe, push
this video to 3k likes so I know you want

00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:15.250
the next arc and sit back and relax as we
delve into the first part of Solo Leveling!

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:16.720
Chapter 1

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:21.110
Kicking things off in Seoul, South Korea,
apologies all my Hyung’s for what's probably

00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:23.490
a terrible accent for Korean pronunciation.

00:01:23.490 --> 00:01:28.720
Either way, we find the worlds weakest hunter,
E-Rank Sung Jin-Woo.

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:32.790
Walking through the streets, brooding over
his ridiculously weak self, Jin finds its

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:34.510
embarrassing to even call himself a hunter.

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:35.680
His life is always on the line, he takes a
brutal amount of damage and has almost died

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:36.680
a few times.

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:40.020
Being a hunter is a Job where you place your
life on the line in the hopes of great return,

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:43.470
however Jin isn't doing this because its a
choice.

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:48.579
Meanwhile, in a construction site, the infamously
known weakest hunter, Sung Jin-Woo, arrives

00:01:48.579 --> 00:01:50.700
to join the other hunters in the raid.

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:55.570
Looking over at him walk past, one returning
hunter, Bak questions if he’s powerful as

00:01:55.570 --> 00:01:57.390
everyone is happy to see him!

00:01:57.390 --> 00:02:02.140
Kim though points out that its the opposite,
he’s the worlds weakest and finds it tough

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:04.880
to even get through an E Rank dungeon.

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:09.399
Figuring that since he’s here its most likely
an extremely weak dungeon, Kim tells his boy

00:02:09.399 --> 00:02:14.400
to quiet his voice since he might over hear
them, to which its revealed that Jin had heard

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.360
the entire convo.

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:21.800
Trying to clear his mind, Jin asks for a coffee
however to his dismay finds that they just

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:22.800
ran out.

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:28.790
Feeling absolutely terrible, the dude apologizes
and Jin walks off a bit let down.

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:32.890
All of a sudden Ju-Hee screams out noticing
that he’s all beaten up!

00:02:32.890 --> 00:02:37.069
Sitting down together, the two chat for a
brief moment about how Jin was sent to the

00:02:37.069 --> 00:02:40.069
hospital following an expedition into an E-Rank
dungeon.

00:02:40.069 --> 00:02:44.040
Getting up, Jin tells her they mise aswell
head over since it looks like everyone's about

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:45.440
to head in.

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:49.920
Gathering everyone around, Song Chiyul, asks
if its alright to take the role as team leader

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:51.360
for this raid!

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:55.580
Everyone agree’s and shortly following this
he heads inside, telling everyone to follow

00:02:55.580 --> 00:02:57.660
him forth into the Dungeon.

00:02:57.660 --> 00:03:01.810
Gaining confidence, Jin-Woo tells himself
to try his best today and enter the portal

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:03.300
last behind everyone.

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:04.750
Chapter 2

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:08.950
Watching everyone leave, the dude from the
coffee stand tells his boy that he feels a

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:13.040
bit s**t since he wasn't able to give Jin
a coffee before he headed in!

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:17.860
Now in the dungeon, Jin-woo is found already
being healed by Joohee and apologizing for

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:19.019
his lack of skills.

00:03:19.019 --> 00:03:23.540
All around them the other members of the group
take care of the remaining monsters.

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:28.400
Thinking that the raid is almost done, Jin-woo
looks over to see everyone in a group talking.

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:33.310
Above their heads you can see a symbol representing
something, these different colors and symbols

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:35.959
each correlate to a members affinity.

00:03:35.959 --> 00:03:39.110
Snapping him back, Joohee asks if he has a
reason?

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:41.230
one stopping him from leaving?

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:45.410
Not wanting to reveal his own personal hell,
Jin laughs while expressing that he does this

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:46.700
for the fun of it.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:50.239
Otherwise he’d die of boredom.

00:03:50.239 --> 00:03:55.239
Song holding a crystal in his hand explains
that this thing is a magical core, an item

00:03:55.239 --> 00:03:57.900
someone receives after killing a monster.

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:02.870
Magical cores from even a C-Rank monster is
worth thousands, yet sadly since Jin is an

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:04.500
E-Rank hunter.

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:07.720
C-Ranks are a mere impossibility for him to
achieve.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:11.920
Holding the pathetic E-Rank core in his hand,
Jin thinks its a bit small after putting his

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:13.709
all into this dungeon.

00:04:13.709 --> 00:04:19.510
As he becomes even more disheartened, a random
yells out that they found another entrance!

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:24.160
Standing infront of the gaping cave entrance,
Song explains that the thing infront of them

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:26.470
is most likely a double lair!

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:31.540
Sparking up his magical flames, Song beautifully
twists a torrent of fire and shoots it forth

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.500
a distance down the tunnel.

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:38.440
Watching it continue, the flame hits the ground
before slowly fading back to black.

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:44.110
Getting everyone's attention, Song elaborates
that the Gate wont close if the Boss is still

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:45.110
alive.

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:49.690
Due to the gate not closing yet, its evident
that the boss is most likely down the tunnel.

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:53.340
Usually they’d need to contact the guild,
but if other people get to the profits first,

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:55.940
then their own profits will dwindle.

00:04:55.940 --> 00:05:00.040
Looking at them all, he instead proposes a
vote on if they should venture forth to kill

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:01.340
the boss.

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:05.680
Since there are 17 of them there it will result
in one side winning and no matter what they

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:08.340
shouldn't complain about what happens.

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:12.650
After a few moments, its shown that the votes
came back 8 to 8 with it all depending on

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:15.470
Jin-woo’s vote if they venture forth.

00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:19.730
Knowing he doesn't have enough money and soon
needs to pay for his sister to attend college,

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:22.500
plus look after his sick mother in hospital.

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:27.390
Jin-woo announces that he is going, meaning
that all 17 of the Hunters will push further

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:28.570
into the dungeon.

00:05:28.570 --> 00:05:30.060
Chapter 3

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:33.710
Wondering how long its been since everyone
entered the cave, someone mentions that its

00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:38.389
been around 40 minutes and the gate will close
an hour after the boss is defeated, so right

00:05:38.389 --> 00:05:41.380
now they have about 20 minutes spare to escape!

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:45.680
Walking together, Jin-woo apologies’ to
Joohee for forcing her to come in here after

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:47.220
voting yes!

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:50.990
Being told that he doesn't need to worry,
Jin pushes further to get the truth, only

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:55.789
for Joohee to rage out and tell him that no,
she currently is not okay!

00:05:55.789 --> 00:05:56.919
Screaming if he’s mental?

00:05:56.919 --> 00:06:02.300
Joohee reveals that the wound Jin initially
received (the one we never saw) was a stab

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:05.070
wound that entered just below where his heart
is.

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:09.580
Coming to see that he really is only alive
because of her, Jin apologizes for dragging

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:11.680
her into it once more.

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:16.099
Smiling, Joohee hints that if he really is
sorry, maybe he should take her out for some

00:06:16.099 --> 00:06:17.460
food to prove it!

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:19.660
Blushing, but unable to say anything.

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:24.010
Joohee asks him if he doesn't want to, to
which he snaps out of the daze and accepts

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:25.699
the date.

00:06:25.699 --> 00:06:31.229
Finally a few more minutes, the group end
up finding a large golden and purple door.

00:06:31.229 --> 00:06:35.229
Asking those following if they want to return
empty handed or not, Song begins pushing the

00:06:35.229 --> 00:06:40.160
door open while saying that they could be
the first ones to ever enter this section.

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:45.160
Creaking open and entering the room, blue
flames ignite, alighting the room and revealing

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:48.090
the large circular space that lays before
them.

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:52.601
Excepting to face magic beasts, the team is
confused and notes that it looks as if no

00:06:52.601 --> 00:06:55.160
one has been here in ages.

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:59.160
Statues surround the room, some holding weapons,
some holding instruments.

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:04.259
The atmosphere makes Jin’s hair stand on
edge and he feels as if someone’s staring

00:07:04.259 --> 00:07:05.910
down on him.

00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:09.940
Not wanting to be caught up with negative
feelings, Jin examines the massive statue

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:12.569
that’s seated in the center back of the
room.

00:07:12.569 --> 00:07:38.479
He assumes it isn't the boss, as its only
a statue, however its the only one this large.

00:07:38.479 --> 00:07:42.230
Looking down, Song randomly finds a moss covered
magic seal.

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:46.759
Yelling out to him, another of the crew calls
him over to read some ancient text.

00:07:46.759 --> 00:07:51.500
Moving over to the text board, Song begins
reading out Carthenons Temple Commandments.

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:53.810
FIRST, worship the lord....

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:55.690
SECOND, praise the lord....

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:57.970
THIRD, prove your faith!

00:07:57.970 --> 00:08:02.310
Being tapped on the shoulder, Jin turns around
to hear Joohee exclaiming that the statue’s

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:03.840
eyeball just moved.

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:07.979
Thinking that she’s tripping, suddenly Jin
starts to feel an aura he hadn’t before.

00:08:07.979 --> 00:08:11.240
The air became chill and all noise stopped.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:15.240
With that Song announces to the group that
anyone who does not follow the previously

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:18.650
mentioned rules, will never return alive...

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:22.639
Slamming behind them, everyone’s heads snap
back to see that the previously open entrance

00:08:22.639 --> 00:08:24.270
has slammed shut.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:28.319
Annoyed with everyone spouting nonsense, one
of the team members announces that he’s

00:08:28.319 --> 00:08:32.140
outa there, they can have whatever treasures
they find, but he’s done.

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:36.849
Wishing them goodluck, he places his hand
apon the door only to hear Song scream out

00:08:36.849 --> 00:08:38.380
for him to wait!!!

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:42.180
Before his voice even reaches the hunter,
a shadow shoots through the room and cleaves

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:43.760
the man down.

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:47.640
Instantly following this, the statue returns
to its position and lowers the weapon.

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:51.950
Horrified to witness the statue coming to
life, the team members are left speechless

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:56.140
knowing that if they want to leave, they need
to beat them!

00:08:56.140 --> 00:09:00.180
Jin-woo remembering a previous statement,
flicks his head around to see the main statue

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:01.970
staring right back at him!

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:02.970
Chapter 4

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:06.890
Thinking about the guy who just died, Jin
knows he was only D-Rank.

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:11.850
Even if he was a weak D-Rank, he still would've
been stronger than an E-Rank like himself.

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:17.280
For those confused with the ranking system.

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:25.290
Simply it starts at E, then D, C, B, A and
finally the strongest at S rank.

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:28.089
The anime has done things slightly differently
as you could tell.

00:09:28.089 --> 00:09:33.709
Not with the power system, its instead added
a few other interactions with other characters

00:09:33.709 --> 00:09:37.990
that never happed in these initial chapters.

00:09:37.990 --> 00:09:54.380
I think its good, cause it expands the world
a little bit more, however I hope they stick

00:09:54.380 --> 00:10:01.720
with mainly Jin’s pov and dont get caught
up in other things to early on.

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:10.690
The pacing is looking like 4 - 5 chapters
per episode, so we will get 55 to 60 chapters,

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:15.570
possibly even more throughout this first season!

00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:19.320
Anyways Anyways!

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:23.140
Confused because this dungeon was meant to
be D-Rank at most, Jin swears that he’s

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:26.950
never heard of monsters as strong as these
inside of a D-Rank dungeon.

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:31.430
In a flashback we find that this wasnt the
first time Jin almost died.

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:36.160
During the first raid he ever went on, he
accidentally left the group and got lost.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:40.960
Then outa no-where a random E-Rank goblin
shanked him from behind, sending him to the

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:42.880
hospital for weeks!

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:48.100
Another time he almost starved to death after
being trapped inside.

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:53.370
Other people in the solo leveling world usually
use their magical cores to trade up for better

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:56.899
weapons, to then fight stronger monsters and
earn even more money!

00:10:56.899 --> 00:10:59.060
Jin cant do this though.

00:10:59.060 --> 00:11:01.829
He never holds a weapon.

00:11:01.829 --> 00:11:08.110
It would just break anyway.

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:12.529
Having a healer means his injuries' would
be able to get healed, but only if it wasn't

00:11:12.529 --> 00:11:14.350
to extreme.

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:19.050
That though means they have to work twice
as hard, babysitting some weakling who can

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:21.070
barely look after himself.

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:24.149
Every time he got injured and heard their
sneering remarks.

00:11:24.149 --> 00:11:27.529
All the times he continued a job that may
result in his demise.

00:11:27.529 --> 00:11:30.240
Maybe it was all for this moment...

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:34.400
Reacting just in time, Jinwoo screams out
for his comrades to duck.

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:38.829
Hearing his warning some hunters stand there
stationary, watching the statue's eye’s

00:11:38.829 --> 00:11:40.050
begin to glow.

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:44.450
Suddenly a beam of light is sent out that
utterly eviscerates anything in its path.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:48.900
Opening their eyes and seeing what remains
of the group, the hunter's horror only furthers

00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:53.790
as they notice that a large portion of them
were taken out.

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:58.800
Making himself heard, Song yells for everyone
to not stand up and remain in their positions.

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:03.589
If they choose to stand back up, the statue
will attack them again!

00:12:03.589 --> 00:12:07.850
With everyone listening, Song creeps over
to Jin and lets him know that even though

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:11.839
Juhee is a B-Rank healer, she cant handle
fear at all.

00:12:11.839 --> 00:12:16.570
While talking with Song, Jin notices that
almost all of his fellow hunters arm was blown

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:18.790
off by the previous attack.

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:23.550
Asking to be bandaged up, Song looks up at
the giant statue and questions his boy what

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:25.910
rank it looks like it could be to him.

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:32.060
Not knowing, due to never having stepped foot
in a dungeon higher than D-Rank, Song who’s

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:37.750
experienced B-Rank a few times is certain
that this being defiantly exceeds that of

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:39.410
a B-Rank boss.

00:12:39.410 --> 00:12:43.949
This one though, he guesses that it could
possibly be a S-Rank creature.

00:12:43.949 --> 00:12:48.060
Thinking on the spot, Jin remembers the commandments
that song read out earlier.

00:12:48.060 --> 00:12:51.290
Worship the lord, Praise the lord and prove
your faith!

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:54.300
Those who do not follow the commandments will
never return alive.

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:56.130
To Jin, its obvious.

00:12:56.130 --> 00:13:00.060
He thinks that the giant godlike statue seated
infront of him, is that lord.

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:01.060
Chapter 5

00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:05.880
In Solo Leveling, these dungeons exist in
a different time space or dimension.

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:09.320
To get there, something called a Gate needs
to be used.

00:13:09.320 --> 00:13:13.280
This Gate is a sort of tunnel that connects
other random worlds to their own.

00:13:13.280 --> 00:13:17.170
10 years earlier after the first gate randomly
appeared in the world.

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:20.130
Many people begun to experience random events.

00:13:20.130 --> 00:13:24.670
One of these random events to happen were
the modification of humans into hunters.

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:29.600
The moment a hunter is chosen, their strength
stays the same and is impossible to change.

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:35.490
Jin too became a hunter, however his strength
was only enough for an E-Rank rating.

00:13:35.490 --> 00:13:40.029
Still Jin is stronger than most individuals,
its just that the difference between him and

00:13:40.029 --> 00:13:42.730
other ranks is drastic.

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:46.279
The men and women who received the powers
to cross the gate and destroy monsters as

00:13:46.279 --> 00:13:48.769
a career were labeled as ‘Hunters’.

00:13:48.769 --> 00:13:50.450
Sometimes, on odd occasions.

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:53.089
Beyond the gate, there can be an, ominous...

00:13:53.089 --> 00:13:54.089
despairing...

00:13:54.089 --> 00:13:58.220
Insane monster that comes out of no-where.

00:13:58.220 --> 00:14:03.029
Wondering if he’s going to be okay, Jin
asks if the bleeding will stop, but Song says

00:14:03.029 --> 00:14:05.630
there really isn't much they can do now.

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:09.449
Initially he’d brought 3 healers here because
he thought this would be over quickly.

00:14:09.449 --> 00:14:14.029
Now though, one got literally vaporized by
the first attack and the other is so shocked

00:14:14.029 --> 00:14:15.889
that he’s unable to move.

00:14:15.889 --> 00:14:20.980
Even the B-Rank healer Joohee has never experienced
anything like this, so its making healing

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:23.009
slightly difficult for the time being.

00:14:23.009 --> 00:14:28.500
For Song, he thinks that the best course of
action is to stand still, then once the situation

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:31.570
clears a tad, try and make a run for it.

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:35.000
Suddenly one of the random hunters breaks
away from the group while claiming that this

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:39.740
isn't his final moment, he finally managed
to join a big guild, so he wont die here.

00:14:39.740 --> 00:14:44.040
Gritting his teeth, the man gasses himself
up and plans to use enough speed to burst

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:45.920
through the door in an instance.

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:49.720
Boosting off and sending rocks flying with
tremendous speed, the hunter begins closing

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:50.790
in on the door.

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:55.120
All of a sudden a burst of light shoots through
the room, evaporating the hunter and leaving

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:57.540
nothing but his feet remaining.

00:14:57.540 --> 00:15:01.990
Groaning with rage, another hunter questions
why it is that the monsters are taking their

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:05.200
time when they could just take them out whenever
they feel like it.

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:08.320
Thinking that this is completely different
from the typical monsters who just blindly

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:09.720
attack on sight.

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:13.519
Jin is able to deduce that the statues seem
to attack in a sort of pattern.

00:15:13.519 --> 00:15:17.900
Snapping his head back towards something,
he figures that it has to be, there has to

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:20.440
be a rule to how this room works.

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:25.100
Analyzing the Commandments Of Carthenon Jin
realizes this is the exact key to surviving

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:26.550
the room.

00:15:26.550 --> 00:15:31.160
Asking what the first commandment was, Song
reminds him that it was to worship the lord.

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:35.089
Pondering what this could possible mean, Jin
starts to get up while explaining that there

00:15:35.089 --> 00:15:37.089
is a rule to this dungeon.

00:15:37.089 --> 00:15:38.089
Chapter 6

00:15:38.089 --> 00:15:42.790
Making his way towards the statue, Jin watches
as the eyes begin to glow and immediately

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:46.600
drops to the floor, sweat starting to drip
from his brow.

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:51.360
Seeing the eye’s glow fade, he assumes that
the being will start to attack if the targeted

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:54.600
person moves past a specific height.

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:59.800
Understanding an aspect of the statue, Jin-woo
tells everyone to bow down before it!

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:03.320
Wondering if he’s gone mad or something,
Song asks if he managed to figure something

00:16:03.320 --> 00:16:04.320
out?

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:09.450
Replying yes, Jin explains that like i've
said the being attacks those who pass a certain

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:10.450
height.

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:15.209
The phrase ‘worship the lord’, literally
means bow down and worship him!

00:16:15.209 --> 00:16:19.839
Following the E-Rankers orders, everyone bows
down and begins worshiping the statue infront

00:16:19.839 --> 00:16:21.110
of them.

00:16:21.110 --> 00:16:24.610
Looking down on them, the light from the statues
eyes randomly disappears.

00:16:24.610 --> 00:16:30.930
Snapping opening, the concrete grin of this
grotesque being opens and its eyes turn red,

00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:34.560
ominously looking down on all of the fodder
hunters below it.

00:16:34.560 --> 00:16:38.811
Feeling its gaze violating them, Jin wonders
how many this creature has attacked in the

00:16:38.811 --> 00:16:39.870
past?

00:16:39.870 --> 00:16:42.350
How many people in their group are still alive?

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:46.920
How long do they have to lay down here and
do this?

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:52.240
Starting to rise, Bak thinks the creatures
stopped and instead of continuing to make

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.500
them bow will try something else soon.

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:59.040
He doubts that just because they bowed down
everything is going to turn out fine.

00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:03.880
One by one everyone slowly rises to their
feet after seeing that the monster has indeed

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:05.789
stopped attacking.

00:17:05.789 --> 00:17:10.679
Suddenly the room begins to shake and the
statue itself begins rising from the seat.

00:17:10.679 --> 00:17:15.299
Stomping on the floor, everyone looks up in
horror, knowing that this entire fiasco isn't

00:17:15.299 --> 00:17:16.299
over.

00:17:16.299 --> 00:17:21.689
Towering above them like a monolithic demonic
god, all the hunters stand their in fear unable

00:17:21.689 --> 00:17:24.040
to move or say anything.

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:27.390
Stepping forth, Song screams at Jin for any
more ideas?

00:17:27.390 --> 00:17:31.669
but due to the frantic nature of the dungeon
he’s unable to think of anything.

00:17:31.669 --> 00:17:35.740
Quickly snapping out of it he remembers the
rules that he started going over earlier.

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:39.350
Knowing that next in the line of commandments
was to praise the lord, Jin guesses that it

00:17:39.350 --> 00:17:41.780
has to be the key to solving this.

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:44.940
Speaking up another random hunters announces
that he’s got this.

00:17:44.940 --> 00:17:50.320
Back in the day he was a member of a church
choir, so his lungs are literally built for

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:51.320
praising!

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:55.940
Grabbing ahold of his cross, the hunter closes
his eyes and starts to approach the Lord.

00:17:55.940 --> 00:18:00.320
Not stopping under fear of death, the hunter
sings for the Lord to make him anew!

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:04.799
As everyone stands around, they wonder if
its working or not and Bak even thinks the

00:18:04.799 --> 00:18:07.180
dudes moving slightly slower now.

00:18:07.180 --> 00:18:12.020
Jin though, mans dripping in a cold sweat
since he’s come to realize the hunter is

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:14.530
praying to the wrong God!

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:19.400
With that, the statue steps down, flattening
the ex Christian below its gigantic foot.

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:20.400
Chapter 7

00:18:20.400 --> 00:18:24.240
Screaming and turning away in fear of the
seemingly inevitable, some people even decide

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:27.830
to start running away in hopes of living for
just a moment longer.

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:33.659
Terrorfied and unable to move, Joohee screams
her final words as the statue squishes her

00:18:33.659 --> 00:18:34.659
too.

00:18:34.659 --> 00:18:39.530
Jk though, big simping Jin was able to double
back and tear her away in time.

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:44.500
Running now Song tells everyone to split up
in an attempt to figure out what to do.

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:49.000
By himself, Bak thinks back on his wife and
the life that he had with his family while

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:51.610
re-iterating that he cant die here!

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:55.730
He’s determined to be a father to his two
children, but this is...

00:18:55.730 --> 00:19:00.260
Thinking he found a safe location to chill
out, Kim screams out to watch his back and

00:19:00.260 --> 00:19:01.620
turn around.

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:06.930
Unable to react in time, the statue cleaved
downwards, slicing our boy Bak in two and

00:19:06.930 --> 00:19:08.809
sending him straight to the shadow realm.

00:19:08.809 --> 00:19:12.030
Just like before, the statue then returns
to its original position.

00:19:12.030 --> 00:19:16.440
Over another side of the room, Jin runs with
Joohee from the statue, wondering how the

00:19:16.440 --> 00:19:19.480
hell he’s meant to praise a God he doesn't
know?

00:19:19.480 --> 00:19:24.159
Analyzing the room, he knows that the room
is encircled with large guards and a colossal

00:19:24.159 --> 00:19:26.390
statue centered at the back.

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:31.409
If one gets to close to a statue, it automatically
attacks them in an instant.

00:19:31.409 --> 00:19:36.760
Randomly as he looks at each individual statue
he see’s a woman one holding a trumpet.

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:40.270
Wondering if they attack with instruments
aswell, Jin knows the others only attack if

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:41.870
you get to close.

00:19:41.870 --> 00:19:44.990
Once you are close its all a predetermined
move set.

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:49.299
Figuring that he’s probably on the right
track, Jin yells out to the remaining people

00:19:49.299 --> 00:19:51.590
to run towards the statues with instruments.

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:56.159
Seeing that he was already next to one, Song
looks over to see the statue begin playing

00:19:56.159 --> 00:19:57.549
a dank tune.

00:19:57.549 --> 00:20:01.760
Backing up Jin's statement, he tells the others
that the statues holding instruments dont

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:02.760
attack!

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:07.570
Finding a statue of his own, Kim breaks down
over the loss of his close friend Bak.

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:12.210
Honestly pretty rough, dude decided to return
to the hunter life, only to get literally

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:20.010
rick rolled by some demonic gods little game.

00:20:20.010 --> 00:20:24.140
Sprinting over to the other side of the room,
both Jin and Joohee stand underneath a man

00:20:24.140 --> 00:20:29.010
with a drum, however it refuses to begin playing
until only one remains.

00:20:29.010 --> 00:20:33.110
Darting off, Jin makes a mad dash towards
the next closest instrument.

00:20:33.110 --> 00:20:38.260
Looking over at the fleeing rat beneath itself,
the statue moves to stomp on Jin.

00:20:38.260 --> 00:20:44.110
Telling himself to push just a tad further,
Jin is able to dodge the foot, however the

00:20:44.110 --> 00:20:47.909
subsequent stomp sends him uncontrollably
tumbling forwards.

00:20:47.909 --> 00:20:52.990
Stunned and unable to move, Jin can only watch
as he slides straight towards a shield wielding

00:20:52.990 --> 00:20:53.990
statue.

00:20:53.990 --> 00:20:57.690
Thrusting downwards, the statue seemingly
pushes its shield into the ground and destroys

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:00.290
the concrete floor as Jin slides into it.

00:21:00.290 --> 00:21:04.160
Joohee screams out in a hope that he some
how made it out alive.

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:09.220
Bloody and barely able to move now, Jin pleads
with whatever force is above for something

00:21:09.220 --> 00:21:11.539
to appear infront of him.

00:21:11.539 --> 00:21:15.550
Rising to his feet and holding onto the thread
that connects him to Life or Death...

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:20.470
He slowly starts to feel like now... even
that may break...

00:21:20.470 --> 00:21:26.850
Closing his eyes, the voice of an angel suddenly
begins singing out!

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:33.080
Below it we see that our boy, laid out has
somehow managed to get lucky and find a statue.

00:21:33.080 --> 00:21:35.070
Laughing at the luck he seems to have.

00:21:35.070 --> 00:21:41.049
We then see that due to all of the music being
played or song being sung, the Lord has stopped

00:21:41.049 --> 00:21:43.650
dead in the center of the room.

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:47.860
Moments later, Joohee sprints over to Jin
and asks him if he’s alright!

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:53.120
Jin tries saying he’s alright, however after
arriving and seeing the terrible state he’s

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:56.659
currently in, Joohee breaks down.

00:21:56.659 --> 00:21:57.840
Chapter 8

00:21:57.840 --> 00:22:02.980
Feeling terrible and probably thinking its
her fault that Jin lost his foot, Joohee puts

00:22:02.980 --> 00:22:06.620
her all into making sure that the wound is
healed!

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:11.770
Outputting to much magic blood spurts from
her nose and she collapses next to Jin.

00:22:11.770 --> 00:22:15.600
Thankful that atleast Jin somehow managed
to survive, Kim points out how the groups

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:17.970
numbers are quickly being whittled away.

00:22:17.970 --> 00:22:23.350
From 17 to only 6 and 2 of those surviving
members are already gravely injured.

00:22:23.350 --> 00:22:27.860
Finding it unfortunate that Song lost his
arm, Kim reminds him that this is all because

00:22:27.860 --> 00:22:31.200
he made a rash decision as the party leader.

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:36.230
Warning him about the impending punishment
for losing so many members, Song, heavy hearted,

00:22:36.230 --> 00:22:38.419
agree’s with what he’s saying.

00:22:38.419 --> 00:22:42.320
Moving once more, everyone's attention is
quickly brought back to the statue.

00:22:42.320 --> 00:22:46.789
Raising its left hand, everyone feels the
ground shake uncontrollably, before infront

00:22:46.789 --> 00:22:50.409
of them a table like object burst through
the floor.

00:22:50.409 --> 00:22:54.570
Once the summoned platform finishes forming,
flames then also appear in the sky around

00:22:54.570 --> 00:22:56.760
the outskirts of the room.

00:22:56.760 --> 00:23:01.230
Looking at the summoning infront of them,
Kim wonders what it could be, only for Jin

00:23:01.230 --> 00:23:03.220
to say that its an altar.

00:23:03.220 --> 00:23:07.299
Elaborating to the other 5 members, he assumes
its one from like an ancient mythology where

00:23:07.299 --> 00:23:10.039
they sacrificed living beings for their lord.

00:23:10.039 --> 00:23:15.140
Backing his assumption up, he re-iterates
that the final commandment was to prove your

00:23:15.140 --> 00:23:16.300
faith!

00:23:16.300 --> 00:23:20.330
Suddenly a light appears in the stomach of
Kim and the man begins with drawing his blade

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:22.919
from a small gateway like opening.

00:23:22.919 --> 00:23:28.500
Even though he thinks he’s dumb, Kim understands
this likely means they need to sacrifice someone!

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:32.430
Pointing his sword towards the gravely injured
Song, Kim demands that the man who brought

00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:34.330
them here step forwards.

00:23:34.330 --> 00:23:39.909
In his mind, Kim feels like Song is responsible
for all 11 deaths that have happened so far.

00:23:39.909 --> 00:23:43.010
Plus he also just agreed to take responsibility
before.

00:23:43.010 --> 00:23:48.400
Seeing where he’s coming from, Song agree’s
on taking responsibility but asks for him

00:23:48.400 --> 00:23:52.150
to lower the sword and let him walk ahead
freely.

00:23:52.150 --> 00:23:56.380
Jin full on disagrees with what's going on,
in his mind he doesn't think its his fault,

00:23:56.380 --> 00:24:01.910
they all voted to come here and its just cowardly
to turn it around and say its his issue now.

00:24:01.910 --> 00:24:06.660
Stumbling upto the altar, Song stare’s down
at the at the weirdly decorated pattern on

00:24:06.660 --> 00:24:08.290
top of it.

00:24:08.290 --> 00:24:12.920
Randomly a normal flame ignites behind him
causing Kim to scream out and ask what the

00:24:12.920 --> 00:24:15.130
hell is happening now?

00:24:15.130 --> 00:24:18.370
Confused himself, Jin asks if this isn't what
they were supposed to do?

00:24:18.370 --> 00:24:23.450
Unable to understand what the flame means
or if the god wanted a sacrifice, Jin asks

00:24:23.450 --> 00:24:27.970
the remaining 4 people infront of him if they
could carry him up to the altar?

00:24:27.970 --> 00:24:32.450
Being carried in by the large guy and other
female, Jin notices that as soon as they enter

00:24:32.450 --> 00:24:35.779
the circle 3 more flames ignited.

00:24:35.779 --> 00:24:39.590
Asking Song if he thinks the others will save
them if they decide to stay here?

00:24:39.590 --> 00:24:43.620
Song begins explaining a feature of how these
gates work.

00:24:43.620 --> 00:24:47.250
For them right now it marks one week since
the gate was opened.

00:24:47.250 --> 00:24:51.900
The statues will start moving before reinforcements
even get close to this part of the dungeon.

00:24:51.900 --> 00:24:57.399
The reason this even matters is because after
1 week of being open, monsters inside of the

00:24:57.399 --> 00:25:00.460
gate can come through.

00:25:00.460 --> 00:25:05.149
The entire purpose of a raid to begin with
is to kill the boss and close the gate before

00:25:05.149 --> 00:25:06.149
time runs out.

00:25:06.149 --> 00:25:10.850
If the people inside of the dungeon fail these
tasks right now, it will mean the monster

00:25:10.850 --> 00:25:15.590
commanding them to do all these random tasks
can get free into their world.

00:25:15.590 --> 00:25:19.120
Turning to the final two members, Jin tells
them that they should come here aswell.

00:25:19.120 --> 00:25:23.570
For every person that steps on the altar,
a flame appears and in his eyes means the

00:25:23.570 --> 00:25:26.429
trial wont begin until everyone’s on it.

00:25:26.429 --> 00:25:30.029
Listening to him and proceeding to stand on
the altar themselves, blue lights suddenly

00:25:30.029 --> 00:25:34.059
shoot along the ground out to the outer edge
of the altar where it lights a corresponding

00:25:34.059 --> 00:25:35.399
blue flame.

00:25:35.399 --> 00:25:39.560
Looking at the ant sized people below it,
the statue waves its hand causing the door

00:25:39.560 --> 00:25:42.210
over the other side of the room to swing open.

00:25:42.210 --> 00:25:46.170
Standing there stunned, everyone wonders what
the hell they should do now!

00:25:46.170 --> 00:25:51.130
Adding to the already tense situation, every
stone statue around the circumference of the

00:25:51.130 --> 00:25:54.030
room slowly begins enclosing in on the group.

00:25:54.030 --> 00:25:55.030
Chapter 9

00:25:55.030 --> 00:25:58.490
Randomly, Jin looks from statue to statue
and see’s their movement cease the moment

00:25:58.490 --> 00:25:59.630
his eyes look at them.

00:25:59.630 --> 00:26:04.409
Turning to Joohee he tells her that she cant
close her eyes here, its just like when they

00:26:04.409 --> 00:26:05.409
were kids.

00:26:05.409 --> 00:26:07.919
The statues will only move when you take your
eyes off them.

00:26:07.919 --> 00:26:12.250
Kinda like those coil heads from lethal but
the movement speed is nerfed.

00:26:12.250 --> 00:26:18.270
Closing her eyes in fear and listening to
the statue take another step, the other female

00:26:18.270 --> 00:26:22.360
hunter screams out in terror before darting
off in an attempt to escape.

00:26:22.360 --> 00:26:26.240
Once she leaves the circle one of the flames
around the outside vanish of the altar vanish

00:26:26.240 --> 00:26:29.399
and she seemingly runs through the doorway
unharmed.

00:26:29.399 --> 00:26:35.130
Absolutely confused with what the hell they
witnessed, everyone questions Jin how she’s

00:26:35.130 --> 00:26:36.130
alive?

00:26:36.130 --> 00:26:39.380
Plus on top of that when she did exit, the
door slightly closed.

00:26:39.380 --> 00:26:44.330
Trying to think, Jin presumes that a blue
flame disappears after a set amount of time.

00:26:44.330 --> 00:26:48.230
One of the red flames that appeared based
on the number of people, also vanished the

00:26:48.230 --> 00:26:49.679
moment she left the circle.

00:26:49.679 --> 00:26:54.200
Due to how straightforward the rules have
been so far, Jin comes to the conclusion that

00:26:54.200 --> 00:26:56.850
the open door is a trap, a false hope.

00:26:56.850 --> 00:27:01.340
The door only opened after the red flames
appeared and closes just slightly every time

00:27:01.340 --> 00:27:03.899
one of the same flames disappear.

00:27:03.899 --> 00:27:06.060
Prove your faith for Jin is literal.

00:27:06.060 --> 00:27:11.559
Meaning that even in terror and danger, with
the sweetest of temptations, keep your faith

00:27:11.559 --> 00:27:13.230
true!

00:27:13.230 --> 00:27:17.630
Apologizing to Jin, the big dude who carried
him over earlier says he doesn't think he

00:27:17.630 --> 00:27:19.529
can take much more of this.

00:27:19.529 --> 00:27:23.820
Throwing Jin to the floor and leaving him
helpless, the man runs off towards a supposed

00:27:23.820 --> 00:27:25.310
false hope.

00:27:25.310 --> 00:27:31.080
Watching another leave, Kim is just baffled
that once again, someone just ran out.

00:27:31.080 --> 00:27:32.870
Screaming out that NO ONE CAN MOVE!

00:27:32.870 --> 00:27:37.440
Jin explains if any less than the amount of
people they currently have leave, the rest

00:27:37.440 --> 00:27:39.340
wont be able to survive.

00:27:39.340 --> 00:27:44.220
Needing an elaboration on what's happening,
Song asks Jin for more info, to which he tells

00:27:44.220 --> 00:27:48.940
him all they need to do is stay still and
watch the statues until the flames disappear!

00:27:48.940 --> 00:27:54.940
The blue flames are a timer and once they
run out everyone will be able to leave!

00:27:54.940 --> 00:27:59.970
Kim tells him that yeah he may be right, but
the door could also slam shut sealing them

00:27:59.970 --> 00:28:02.900
in here when the flames run out.

00:28:02.900 --> 00:28:06.510
Throughout all the previous dungeons he’s
gone through with Jin, Kim never imagined

00:28:06.510 --> 00:28:08.580
someone as weak as him would be helpful.

00:28:08.580 --> 00:28:12.450
He always looked down on him and never really
expected anything from him.

00:28:12.450 --> 00:28:17.279
A lot of people initially died when they got
here, but the ones who are alive are because

00:28:17.279 --> 00:28:18.640
of his quick thinking.

00:28:18.640 --> 00:28:24.250
Kim thanks him for everything so far, however
as he throws his sword to the ground begins

00:28:24.250 --> 00:28:25.350
tearing up.

00:28:25.350 --> 00:28:29.640
He reveals he also has a family and doesn't
want to die yet!

00:28:29.640 --> 00:28:34.790
Not being able to take the fear of death anymore,
Kim apologizes one more time, before leaving

00:28:34.790 --> 00:28:38.080
the circle and making a run for freedom.

00:28:38.080 --> 00:28:42.500
With tears in his eyes, Jin drops to the floor
utterly pissed off with everyone's apparent

00:28:42.500 --> 00:28:43.500
selfishness.

00:28:43.500 --> 00:28:46.799
Now that Kim's run, the remaining 3 have no
chance.

00:28:46.799 --> 00:28:48.650
Its doomed them to a cruel death.

00:28:48.650 --> 00:28:49.650
Chapter 10

00:28:49.650 --> 00:28:54.029
Looking defeated, Song points out that the
doors nearly closed.

00:28:54.029 --> 00:28:59.039
Its too late now, but he finally understands
what's going on.

00:28:59.039 --> 00:29:03.010
Knowing that the door wont close as long as
there’s at least one person on the altar,

00:29:03.010 --> 00:29:07.529
Song tells the others to leave, since they
naturally have a lot more life to live.

00:29:07.529 --> 00:29:12.269
Turning to Joohee, he asks if she’d be able
to help Jin out of the room, to which she

00:29:12.269 --> 00:29:13.350
instantly agrees!

00:29:13.350 --> 00:29:17.720
Sadly though, Joohee collapses to the floor
before she’s even able to attempt picking

00:29:17.720 --> 00:29:18.880
Jin up.

00:29:18.880 --> 00:29:21.940
Seeing her legs shaking, Joohee cries out
that they wont move!

00:29:21.940 --> 00:29:28.840
Sadly and due to Joohee using to much Mana
in an attempt to heal Jin, she’s exhausted

00:29:28.840 --> 00:29:35.580
herself to the point she can no longer move.

00:29:35.580 --> 00:29:40.000
Taking the old dudes place, Jin tells him
that he should instead take Joohee out of

00:29:40.000 --> 00:29:41.000
here.

00:29:41.000 --> 00:29:44.671
Disagreeing Song tries saying that he’ll
stay but obviously Jin points out that no

00:29:44.671 --> 00:29:49.610
one will be able to carry Joohee, plus there’s
no time so they need to run!

00:29:49.610 --> 00:29:54.429
Screaming out that she’d rather stay here,
Jin reminds her that he promised he’d buy

00:29:54.429 --> 00:29:55.600
her dinner...

00:29:55.600 --> 00:30:00.730
Pulling out his pathetic E-Rank core, Jin
tells her to eat the dinner first.

00:30:00.730 --> 00:30:04.860
Then once he returns, he’ll find her for
payment.

00:30:04.860 --> 00:30:10.059
Going to say something, Joohee is quickly
knocked out as Song picks her up and tells

00:30:10.059 --> 00:30:13.250
Jin there really isn't any more time to wait.

00:30:13.250 --> 00:30:17.750
Asking the old man to take care of her, Song
promises that he will, before slowly making

00:30:17.750 --> 00:30:20.020
his leave with Joohee.

00:30:20.020 --> 00:30:24.659
Seeing them escape through the door to safety,
Jin thanks god as at least he’s the only

00:30:24.659 --> 00:30:26.530
one that’s dying now.

00:30:26.530 --> 00:30:31.570
(Interesting aspect aswell, think about how
in that moment he weirdly ‘praises god’.

00:30:31.570 --> 00:30:40.179
Idk is something i've just noticed as i've
begun scripting the series.

00:30:40.179 --> 00:30:45.220
Its almost unintentional from his side, but
im curious as to if it held any credence).

00:30:45.220 --> 00:30:46.220
Anyways

00:30:46.220 --> 00:30:54.490
Feeling like an idiot, Jin beats himself up
over not having got a life insurance incase

00:30:54.490 --> 00:30:55.519
of this happening.

00:30:55.519 --> 00:30:59.799
Looking over and seeing Kim's sword on the
ground, Jin picks it up and decides that in

00:30:59.799 --> 00:31:04.159
his final moments he’s gonna take at least
one of these monsters down with him.

00:31:04.159 --> 00:31:08.850
Bloodshot eyes and completely unable to stand
due to his missing foot, Jin points the blade

00:31:08.850 --> 00:31:11.659
forth and tells the monsters to ‘come’.

00:31:11.659 --> 00:31:20.049
In a flash, the closest monster strikes down
on Jin, ripping through his chest with complete

00:31:20.049 --> 00:31:21.070
ease.

00:31:21.070 --> 00:31:24.980
Coughing blood and screaming in pain, the
monster doesn't stop.

00:31:24.980 --> 00:31:28.650
Instead it removes its spear, flinging Jin
up into the air.

00:31:28.650 --> 00:31:34.760
Falling down atop the altar, and barely breathing
now, our boy exclaims, he doesn't want, doesn't

00:31:34.760 --> 00:31:36.470
want to die!

00:31:36.470 --> 00:31:39.350
Tears pour from his eyes and thoughts begin
to rush his mind.

00:31:39.350 --> 00:31:42.690
‘This isn't fine’ ‘What do you mean
thankful?’

00:31:42.690 --> 00:31:46.000
Done with everything, he questions why everyone
betrayed him?

00:31:46.000 --> 00:31:47.559
He also has a family...

00:31:47.559 --> 00:31:50.049
He also doesn't want to die...

00:31:50.049 --> 00:31:52.840
Remembering he said he’s glad that he’s
the only one dying.

00:31:52.840 --> 00:31:54.980
Jin tells himself he’s a freaking liar.

00:31:54.980 --> 00:31:57.639
He... he never wanted to die.

00:31:57.639 --> 00:32:01.851
Now laying there and watching his life come
to its close, Jin wishes that he had just

00:32:01.851 --> 00:32:03.860
one more chance.

00:32:03.860 --> 00:32:05.090
STRIKING DOWNWARDS!

00:32:05.090 --> 00:32:08.500
Suddenly the entire altar erupts with a plethora
of different lights and flames.

00:32:08.500 --> 00:32:13.309
The blade from the statue slowly begins to
come to a stop, until it ceases, stuck...

00:32:13.309 --> 00:32:15.399
Randomly a screen appears above Jin.

00:32:15.399 --> 00:32:18.130
Confused he wonders what the hell this could
be?

00:32:18.130 --> 00:32:21.299
Looking closer, the random screen reads Alarm!

00:32:21.299 --> 00:32:25.940
You sir are dank and have completed all necessary
requirements of the secret quest!

00:32:25.940 --> 00:32:27.830
‘Courage Of The Weak’

00:32:27.830 --> 00:32:35.090
Still acting blazed cause dudes got a hole
in his chest, Jin cant seem to even comprehend

00:32:35.090 --> 00:32:36.460
what just happened.

00:32:36.460 --> 00:32:41.000
Suddenly another screen pops up asking if
he will accept the right to become a player.

00:32:41.000 --> 00:32:44.590
Then another reminding him that he doesn't
have much time at all remaining.

00:32:44.590 --> 00:32:49.620
If he actually refuses this random request,
then his heart will stop approximately 0.02

00:32:49.620 --> 00:32:51.809
seconds after.

00:32:51.809 --> 00:32:54.880
Realizing that if he accepts, he doesn't need
to die.

00:32:54.880 --> 00:32:56.640
Jin takes it!

00:32:56.640 --> 00:33:02.100
Welcoming him as player, Jin's bruised, cut
and limp body is suddenly engulfed by beams

00:33:02.100 --> 00:33:05.070
of light so bright he’s physically hidden
from view.

00:33:05.070 --> 00:33:06.070
Outro

00:33:06.070 --> 00:33:10.200
Well I guess that is one way to end the first
arc of the series, on a more or less cliffhanger

00:33:10.200 --> 00:33:13.030
WHICH like we all know dudes fine.

00:33:13.030 --> 00:33:18.610
Otherwise idk what all this light novel jargon,
or the almost 100 chapters of a webtoon would

00:33:18.610 --> 00:33:19.610
be about.

00:33:19.610 --> 00:33:23.240
Though it would be funny man if man killed
his main character at chapter 10 then decided

00:33:23.240 --> 00:33:25.240
to re-create him.

00:33:25.240 --> 00:33:30.390
I guess that is kinda what happens in a way,
like man was 0.2 seconds off dying and well

00:33:30.390 --> 00:33:34.299
if you’ve seen what comes next, mans a completely
new person.

00:33:34.299 --> 00:33:38.620
Speaking of next, if you have all enjoyed
this D-Rank Dungeon arc for Solo leveling,

00:33:38.620 --> 00:33:43.010
then make sure to push this video to 3000
likes so I know you all want more and check

00:33:43.010 --> 00:33:46.500
out the webcomic for yourselves, its a really
easy read.

00:33:46.500 --> 00:33:53.059
No brain power needed at all, its just the
typical brute fest and I love that.

00:33:53.059 --> 00:33:59.289
Of course if you happen to be new around here
aswell, then subscribe and check out the multitude

00:33:59.289 --> 00:34:01.220
of different series i've covered now!

00:34:01.220 --> 00:34:08.600
Either way thank you all for 200k again its
actually insane, but for now its been your

00:34:08.600 --> 00:34:11.580
professional degenerate Diavolo and ill see
you all in a bit, bye!

